    "chunk_text": ", heafod \u00fe\u00e6s Sona \u00fea heo mid ofste inn to \u00feam cinincge eode, heo b\u00e6d & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic wylle \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u me hr\u00e6dlice \u00dea wear\u00f0 se cinincg geunret for \u00feam a\u00f0e, & for \u00feam \u00f0e him mid s\u00e6ton; Nolde \u00feeah hi geunretan. Ac sende \u00e6nne cwellere & bebead \u00fe\u00e6t man his heafod on anum disce brohte; And he hine \u00fea on & his heafod on disce brohte & hit sealde \u00feam m\u00e6dene, & \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den hit sealde hire meder. \u00d0a his cnihtas \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrdon hi comon & his lic namon, & hine on byrgene ledon. So\u00f0lice \u00fea \u00f0a apostolas tog\u00e6dere comon, hi cyddon \u00feam H\u00e6lende eall \u00fe\u00e6t hi dydon & hi l\u00e6rdon. & he s\u00e6de him, cuma\u00f0 & uton gan onsundron on weste stowe, & us hwon restan; So\u00f0lice manega & on scype stigende, hi foron onsundran on weste stowe. & gesawon hi farende, & hi gecneowon manega; And gangende of \u00feam burgum \u00feyder urnon, & him And \u00fea se H\u00e6lend \u00f0anon eode, he geseah mycele menegu, & he gemiltsode him for \u00feam \u00fee hi w\u00e6ron & \u00fea hit mycel ylding w\u00e6s, his leorningcnihtas him to comon & cw\u00e6don, \u00feeos stow is weste & tima Forl\u00e6t \u00feas menegu, \u00fe\u00e6t hi faran on gehende tunas, & him mete bicgan, \u00fe\u00e6t hi eton. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, sylle ge him etan; \u00f0a cw\u00e6don hi uton gan, & mid twam hundred penegon hlafas bicgan, \ufffd",
